; personality.xon -- what this bundle IS.
;
; xon: read with the ordinary reader and never evaluated, like every other
; manifest in the x-lang world.  A form a reader does not know is a loud error.

(personality "r5rs")

; XENON, and this one is derived from a measurement rather than a preference.
; Scheme's numerics are the tower: string->number falls back to %float,
; 20-numeric-tower.spec.md exercises rationals and complexes, and none of that
; is in helium.  It is NOT radon -- the only thing here that wanted dlopen was
; scm/ports.scm, which this release does not load.  Restoring ports moves this
; row to rn, which is exactly the kind of change (dialect ...) exists to make
; visible.
(dialect xe)

; PAIRING, NOT PINNING.  Compared for EQUALITY, never parsed.
(requires-release "0.5.2")

(entry "run.x")
